00:31:15.000 --> 00:31:44.000
We need to know more, he says, about what happens to our infrastructure at the further reaches of a five. So the issue for us is testing at all levels, all intensities of a storm. We have to be thinking about a facility that goes beyond the current capabilities of the wall of wind. That's why they've gotten a big government grant to figure out how to build a bigger, more beefed up lab.
