were expecting was not going to change. It didn't matter that the storm was weakening. The rainfall and the surge were still going to be very bad. So we made a concerted effort that in our communications, we did not say the storm is weakening. They wanted people to focus on the risks of storm surge. And what you know is that as soon as we sent out the advisory, we started getting notices on our phone. And what do you think the headlines were? It's weakening. It's weakening. It's downgraded to category one. So the message is that we were intentionally trying to avoid,
并没有改变。风暴在减弱并不重要。降雨和风暴潮仍然会非常糟糕。因此我们做出了一致的努力，在我们的交流中，我们没有说风暴在减弱。他们希望人们关注风暴潮的风险。你知道的，就在我们发出警报后不久，我们的手机上就开始收到通知。你认为头条新闻是什么？它在减弱。它在减弱。它已经降级为一级。所以我们原本刻意想要避免的信息，

