they were still getting out there in the media because journalists were writing stories and that's what they were attached to is the wind speed. Yeah, we suck. That's not what I'm saying at all. It's just that- No, no, I'll say it. There's just, there's no one way
仍然出现在媒体上，因为记者们在写报道，而他们所关注的正是风速。是的，我们糟透了。我根本不是这个意思。只是——不，不，我来明说吧。根本没有哪一种方法

