Again, here's Hugh Willoughby. You know, another thing. We have hurricane watches and hurricane warnings. Both begin with W, they're about the same length. You know, there ought to be more psychological distance between them. I agree. I can never tell what the difference is. Are they not just synonyms? Right. Yeah, and that's... Thank you. I thought I was really stupid. Well, no. You want the social scientists, the anthropologists, the communicators, all these people, you want them talking to the people who do the meteorology so
